    # SET-2214: parts must sum to the total. This assertion previously
    # pinned [33, 33, 33] -- the floor-only output introduced by the 2021
    # "simplification" (49f71f0) that dropped the remainder pass. The
    # leftover cent now goes to the first part, matching the original
    # 2019 behaviour. NOTE: this shifts reconcile.daily_report() output
    # by one cent; see HANDOFF.md before shipping.
    assert allocate(100, [1, 1, 1]) == [34, 33, 33]


